{"text":"And then we do a much greater disservice to girls, because we raise them to cater to the fragile egos of men. We teach girls to shrink themselves, to make themselves smaller. We say to girls, you can have ambition, but not too much. You should aim to be successful, but not too successful, otherwise you will threaten the man. If you are the breadwinner in your relationship with a man, you have to pretend that you're not. Especially in public, otherwise you will emasculate him. But what if we question the premise itself? Why should a woman's success be a threat to a man? What if we decide to simply dispose of that word? And I don't think there's an English word I dislike more than emasculation.","words":[{"text":"And","start":0.0,"end":0.9},{"text":"then","start":0.9,"end":1.04},{"text":"we","start":1.04,"end":1.18},{"text":"do","start":1.18,"end":1.44},{"text":"a","start":1.44,"end":1.6},{"text":"much","start":1.6,"end":1.9},{"text":"greater","start":1.9,"end":2.24},{"text":"disservice","start":2.24,"end":2.76},{"text":"to","start":2.76,"end":3.12},{"text":"girls","start":3.12,"end":3.5,"punct":","},{"text":"because","start":3.76,"end":3.98},{"text":"we","start":3.98,"end":4.16},{"text":"raise","start":4.16,"end":4.42},{"text":"them","start":4.42,"end":4.62},{"text":"to","start":4.62,"end":4.9},{"text":"cater","start":4.9,"end":5.14},{"text":"to","start":5.14,"end":5.6},{"text":"the","start":5.6,"end":5.72},{"text":"fragile","start":5.72,"end":6.06},{"text":"egos","start":6.06,"end":6.44},{"text":"of","start":6.44,"end":6.6},{"text":"men","start":6.6,"end":6.86,"punct":"."},{"text":"We","start":7.94,"end":8.12},{"text":"teach","start":8.12,"end":8.32},{"text":"girls","start":8.32,"end":8.6},{"text":"to","start":8.6,"end":8.86},{"text":"shrink","start":8.86,"end":9.16},{"text":"themselves","start":9.16,"end":9.7,"punct":","},{"text":"to","start":9.96,"end":10.04},{"text":"make","start":10.04,"end":10.16},{"text":"themselves","start":10.16,"end":10.56},{"text"